,"released":"2026-05-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Amber reunites with her family and Tibor confronts his mother, buried secrets bring unexpected understanding. But a single misstep thrusts them into their most dangerous battle yet.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pPcrD8SR58JXCNesfaW6y0rFLGG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1ByaXNvbmVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.5","title":"Betrayal","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With her family in danger, Amber and Tibor hunt down O'Neill as Tebbit uncovers the crime syndicate's deadly plan. Desperate to find her baby, Amber seeks out her estranged, incarcerated mother for help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fIitgZEcGaACPPSwgLR8icAlCru.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1ByaXNvbmVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.6","title":"The Showdown","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In the gripping season finale, Amber and Tibor race through London to reach the Old Bailey as they are relentlessly pursued. Facing mounting threats, Tibor makes a devastating choice with far-reaching consequences.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bHmWwrRwQZQIUXT48V1AmOSvVvj.jpg"}]}}